OL,3,GNEWSAHope to boost crowds for Goose
OL,4,AFair tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoose Fair officials hope more people
OL,7,Fwill take the opportunity to witness
OL,8,Fthe event's traditional opening this
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe fair, which dates back more than
OL,12,F700 years, returns to the Forest
OL,13,FRecreation Ground in Nottingham from
OL,14,FFriday at 12:00 BST and will run until
OL,15,F4 October.
OL,17,FThis year's opening ceremony, which
OL,18,Ffeatures the ringing of two silver
OL,19,Fbells, will take place on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
