OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1790065547
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHope to boost crowds for Goose
OL,4,AFair tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Mellors, operations director of
OL,7,Fthe Mellors Group, which helps
OL,8,Fco-ordinate the fair, said: "It was
OL,9,Fmassively attended back in the day. I
OL,10,Fthink the tradition has been lost a
OL,11,Flittle with this generation, and we're
OL,12,Ftrying to get involved with the local
OL,13,Fcommunity more by having the opening
OL,14,Fday back on the Friday."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
